{{Splblocknotes
| name = Medusa Mystic Snake
| desc = Procs [[Spell Block]] sources upon impact on each individual enemy hero per hit.<br><br>The {{M|projectile}} stops {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} bouncing and immediately returns and applies the {{M|mana restore}} component.
}}
{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Medusa Mystic Snake
| desc = Procs [[Spell Reflection]] sources only on the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy hero.
}}

 * The ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
*** Has a {{#var:Mystic Snake value3}}-base projectile speed.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Increased icon.png|21px]]
**** Subsequent projectile impacts per valid enemy unit increases the following ability values:
***** The {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} bounce {{M|projectile speed}} between valid enemy units and its projectile return speed.
***** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**** Grants a non-lingering 100-radius [[flying vision]] centered around the [[projectile]].
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** The projectile bounces to the next, nearest valid enemy unit within the radius centered around the primary target.
**** Does not bounce to the same unit per cast.
**** Bounce to the following units:
***** {{M|Fogged units}}.
**** Does not bounce to the following units:
***** {{M|Hidden}} units.
***** {{M|Invisible}} units.
***** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
**** If the current bounced target is affected by the aformentioned sources upon impact, the bounce neither counts nor increases the ability values. In this situation, the {{M|projectile}} continue bouncing to nearby valid targets.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** {{Symbol|bonus mprestore}}
**** The [[mana restore]] component considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
**** Needs to offensively affect enemy units with a combined {{calc|ceil(v1/{{#var:Mystic Snake value5}}*10000)|v1={{#var:Mystic Snake mp}}}} total {{M|mana}} to fully reclaim its mana cost.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** {{M|Projectile speed}}: {{Code|{{#var:Mystic Snake value3}} × {{#var:Mystic Snake type1 value1}} ^ f(Bounce)}}
*** {{M|Magical}} {{M|spell damage}}: {{Code|{{#var:Mystic Snake value4}} × {{#var:Mystic Snake type1 value2}} ^ f(Bounce)}}
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** {{M|Mana restore}}: {{Code|Σ (MAX[[Mana]] Value of All Hit Enemies) × {{#var:Mystic Snake value5}}}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Mystic Snake icon0}}
| desc = A mystic snake made of energy jumps from target to target dealing damage. Damage and speed increases with each jump. After it reaches its last target, it returns to Medusa to replenish her with mana. The snake returns a percentage of the targets' total mana.
}}
* Deals the following {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} per hit enemy unit:

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
*** Has the following {{M|projectile speed}} per bounce:
**** {{#invoke:Lua|invoke|module=loop|fn=ps|0|5|<nowiki>{{#expr:{{#var:Mystic Snake value3}}*{{#var:Mystic Snake type1 value1}}^{{#var:ps}} round2}} {{to}} </nowiki>}} {{#expr:{{#var:Mystic Snake value3}}*{{#var:Mystic Snake type1 value1}}^5}}

